  "about": "Tapscript FILL leaf terms at the 2^63 edge. rate_num, rate_den and min_lot below 2^63 build the leaf (fill_leaf, by seqdex pkg/covenant BuildFillLeaf over asset_a, asset_b, maker_prog); a term at 2^63 or more is refused (refused names it): OP_MUL64, OP_DIV64 and OP_GREATERTHANOREQUAL64 read it as negative, and the order would fill for any credit. Go (BuildFillLeaf, CheckTerms) and the web wallet's covenant.js agree on every case.",
